ke seismic data and  well logs that describe transitions  between geologic layers we can add  publicly available information about  surrounding geologies and industry  activities developing still richer ways  of seeing our data with new  understanding and this is really  literally decades of human work seen in  the context of millions of years of  geology and this is really just the  beginning for us we have new ways of  seeing and using legacy and modern data  and linking it with real time business  processes happening within Chevron  around the globe each day from earth  science to facilities engineering to  environment and safety and beyond  through our collaboration with Google we  have developed a framework that enables  us to do more together connecting our  technical experts to our data and to  each other and that's really made  possible by what our hosts today are  calling one Google thank you  [Music]

